For completeness, this issue has been Solved (or at least a work-around).
Based on
https://groups.google.com/a/cloudera.org/forum/#!topic/cdh-user/V6Td-XRQC_8 <https://groups.google.com/a/cloudera.org/forum/#%21topic/cdh-user/V6Td-XRQC_8>
